---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Payment Planning - SkanPay"
  description="SkanPay helps teams map QR checkout requests, payment states, redemption logic, and partner responsibilities before implementation."
  activePath="/services/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1>Payment discovery for QR checkout programs</h1>
    <p>For teams evaluating QR acceptance, wallet participation, merchant status, or redemption at checkout.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="grid two">
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Request mapping</h3>
        <p>Define amount, merchant reference, buyer context, and the result the seller needs.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>QR payload boundary</h3>
        <p>Clarify what lives inside the code and what should be resolved after scan.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Status model</h3>
        <p>Plan pending, approved, cancelled, expired, failed, and completed states.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>App handoff</h3>
        <p>Identify where a wallet, payment app, loyalty app, or commerce app takes over.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Redemption logic</h3>
        <p>Map where coupons, rewards, vouchers, or stored value affect the total.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>06</span>
        <h3>Processor alignment</h3>
        <p>Keep authorization, clearing, and settlement responsibilities explicit.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="cta-band-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Next step</p>
        <h2>Bring a real checkout scenario.</h2>
        <p>We can review the request, status path, and partner boundary together.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Contact SkanPay</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
